# Paths that must NOT be synced to the PUBLIC repo
# (github.com/databricks-solutions/solution-builder).
#
# This repo (databricks-field-eng/industry-demo-prompts) is the PRIVATE source;
# the public repo is a mirror. Whatever job mirrors private→public MUST exclude
# every path listed here. Each is internal-only content (live Demo-West links,
# internal catalogs) that should never appear in the open-source project.
#
# Syntax: gitignore-style globs, repo-root-relative.

# Internal deploy overlays — real workspace/Lakebase IDs, endpoint names, admin
# emails for the official prod / staging / FEVM deployments. No secrets, but
# internal-only. The public repo ships only the *.example templates.
app/databricks.prod.yml
app/databricks.staging.yml
app/databricks.prod-fevm.yml
